# vm-bake - bake images and guest configurations for vm-bhyve: templates
# (the build recipe), images (the baked snapshot), guests (a clone with its
# rendered vm.conf and the shares on the host), sessions (the client script).
# Emit-and-inspect: every command generates shell, an interpreter the user
# pins decides whether it is shown or run. Combinator engine, forked from
# elvboot.
#
# POSIX shell compliant (tested on FreeBSD sh).
#
# === METADATA (generated by make metadata) ===
# Terminal functions      (single underscore _):   emit shell commands
# Combinator functions     (double underscore __):  emit ONE re-invocation
# Batch-combinator functions (triple underscore ___): emit SEVERAL re-invocations
